(1290, 348, 670, 'New testment reportes many revelatory acts of God like jesus manifestation,christ earthly ministry, acts of holy spiritin the first century curch,also acts of God the futur,such as glorious return of Christ,judgement and all,inoher hand new testament also report the word Revelation associated with acts of God spoke,angel spoke,the spirit of God reveal,spirit spoke to human,  \r\n new testament reveals both the action and the word of God ,Christ, and te holy spirit also the acts and the works of appstels,becouse God revealing self with action and their word,this twofold concepts of act and word revaluation of God wefindin Testament .some acts of God revealed by the subsequent of revelation .', 8, '2019-12-11 05:45:52', '2019-12-18 21:26:22', NULL),
(1291, 348, 671, 'The old testment theology developed by the passing of time,each time God revealed him self  by acting and speaking in history ,to one degree to another, God spoke throgh the prophets about the out poring of blessing over israel by obeying the word of God and bringing them back to the nation from exile ,and in many other way god deal with them, but in new testament church was developed ina short period, they never go thrugh the way old testent people gone, they never seen plenty of wealth,and femen ,they were persecuted continuously , new testament theologian not focused on different historical progress .', 9, '2019-12-11 06:00:46', '2019-12-18 21:26:22', NULL),
