(1424, 425, 626, 'Now we have explorer the rehtorycal strategy and content of acts, what are some of the mainissue to consider as we aplaied the truth of book of acts, we will first focous on litery charecter ,second we will talk about some discontinuities,thirdly continuities\r\nLiterary character:Different kind of literature communicate thier idea in different way,  there are historical narratives , poems ,speach, parables , poem, law, and so,they are selective , Episodic, and Implicit, Every historian has been selective, there are simply selective,an astoniding number of significent took place in the church during this time, still luke only wrote his books in 28 chappetr, matter was selective, Episodic: beside the selective matter are the episodical,luke has strategy in message , every small point make each matted details, Imlicit: two main type of literature in the bible, argumative discours, representative competitiontechers directly and , explicity', 7, '2020-04-22 10:16:49', '2020-04-22 15:59:42', NULL),
