(2815, 738, 977, '1) Organic Inspiration\r\nIt\'s common to describe the historical evangelical view of the divine inspiration of scripture as organic inspiration  \r\nWe use this terminology to indicate that his inspiration was not divorced from the personality, experience and intention of human author. \r\nInfallible supervision of the holy Spirit\r\nThe human author themselves what to write. The Bible did not results from mechanical inspiration, as if God used human writinr as passive conduits, nor was the Bible romantically inspired\r\n2 Peter 3:15 Peter say Paul letter were written with the wisdom given to Paul by God. Other word God\'s spirit inspired Paul\'s letter so that not matter human writing, \r\nThis same outlook old testament \r\nThen we say old testament law is God\'s law \r\n\r\n2) Divine Accommodation\r\nBroadly say accommodation is a team that theologian use to describe the fact that every time God reveals himself to humanity , he spek to us in finite human team, because God is transcends and incomprehensible\r\nIs 55:8 God\'s thought and way are so transcendent they so infinitely exceed our limitations that every revelation he has ever made has been accommodation to human capacity, he did this so that at least some of us could understand and follow what he reveals', 8, '2021-12-15 15:50:28', '2022-01-15 15:21:58', NULL),
