(823, 74, 'Describe the connections between the flood of Noah’s day and the experience of Israel in Moses’ day. What implications did Moses intend his audience to draw from these connections?', 10, '2020-04-17 01:27:20', '2020-04-16 18:27:20', 1, 1),
(824, 74, 'How did the inauguration of the kingdom correspond to the themes Moses emphasized in Genesis 6:9–11:9?', 10, '2020-04-17 01:27:20', '2020-04-16 18:27:20', 1, 1),
