(211, 7, 'All the following are Biblical reasons why we need to plant more churches, except . . .', 'The Great Commission (?Go, make disciples of all nations?)', 'TheGreatChallenge(?Occupy till I come?)', 'TheGreatChoice(?You have not chosen me,but I have chosen you?)', 'he Great Complaint (?I poured out my complaint before him?)', '', 'he Great Complaint (?I poured out my complaint before him?)', 0.00, '2017-01-20 01:50:04', '2017-01-19 18:50:04', 0, 0),
