(267, 8, 'Another characteristic of the Book of Hebrews is the prophecies and symbolism of the end times.\r\n', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'FALSE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 02:15:04', '2017-01-19 19:15:04', 0, 0),
