(362, 10, 'The prophets spoke and wrote in poetic form because_________.', 'Poetry is the language of the heart, and God?s goal was to speak to the heart.', 'The Jewish people loved the rhythm of iambic pentameter.', 'Only the Jewish people in Old Testament times understood poetry; therefore, those to\r\nwhom it was not intended would not be able to understand the message.\r\n', 'They were skilled in all types of poetry as a result of their training.', '', 'Poetry is the language of the heart, and God?s goal was to speak to the heart.', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:05:04', '2017-01-19 20:05:04', 0, 0),
