(383, 10, 'The Book of Jeremiah can be divided into eight sections. The first section talks about___.', 'Phony religion', 'Judah?s judgment', 'Jeremiah?s journey to the end', 'Jeremiah?s call', '', 'Jeremiah?s call', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:15:03', '2017-01-19 20:15:03', 0, 0),
(384, 10, 'Jeremiah?s prayer life could be compared to_____________in the Old Testament.', 'Jacob', 'Abraham', 'Samuel', 'David', '', 'Jacob', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:15:03', '2017-01-19 20:15:03', 0, 0),
(385, 10, 'One of Jeremiah?s object lessons consisted of a__________________.\r\n', 'Banner', 'A half-eaten loaf of bread', 'A wooden ox yoke', 'A letter to God', '', 'A wooden ox yoke', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:15:03', '2017-01-19 20:15:03', 0, 0),
(386, 10, 'The last record we have of Jeremiah is in the country of________________.', 'Babylon', 'Egypt', 'Assyria', 'Jordan', '', 'Egypt', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:15:03', '2017-01-19 20:15:03', 0, 0),
(387, 11, 'The Exile of Israel lasted 65 years.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'FALSE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:15:03', '2017-01-19 20:15:03', 0, 0),
(388, 11, 'The Exile is described in the Books of Jeremiah and Lamentations.\r\n', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:15:03', '2017-01-19 20:15:03', 0, 0),
(389, 11, 'The Israelites were deported in two groups at two different time periods.\r\n', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'FALSE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:15:03', '2017-01-19 20:15:03', 0, 0),
(390, 11, 'The goal of the Exile was to refine God?s people and move them to repentance and faith, not to destroy them.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:15:03', '2017-01-19 20:15:03', 0, 0),
(391, 11, 'Without the Temple, the religious worship of the Jews shifted to the centrality of the Scripture during the Exile.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:15:03', '2017-01-19 20:15:03', 0, 0),
(392, 11, 'Ezekiel has been called the strangest of the prophets, because he rarely used imagery or symbolism.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'FALSE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:20:04', '2017-01-19 20:20:04', 0, 0),
(393, 11, 'The Book of Ezekiel has a twofold theme: judgment and hope.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:20:04', '2017-01-19 20:20:04', 0, 0),
(394, 11, 'Ezekiel\\\'s vision of the valley of dry bones was really a sacred message of encouragement, because it portrayed Israel\\\'s new birth as a nation.\r\n', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:20:04', '2017-01-19 20:20:04', 0, 0),
(395, 11, 'Obadiah can be regarded as a contemporary of Ezekiel.\r\n', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:20:04', '2017-01-19 20:20:04', 0, 0),
(396, 11, 'Obadiah\\\'s basic message was the prediction of the destruction of Israel.\r\n', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:20:04', '2017-01-19 20:20:04', 0, 0),
(397, 11, 'Daniel was taken captive to Babylon in the first deportation of Israelites.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:20:04', '2017-01-19 20:20:04', 0, 0),
(398, 11, 'The theme of the Book of Daniel is the sovereignty of God.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:20:04', '2017-01-19 20:20:04', 0, 0),
(399, 11, 'One of the four great truths of the Book of Daniel is that God rules over the nations.\r\n', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:20:04', '2017-01-19 20:20:04', 0, 0),
(400, 11, 'Daniel\\\'s interpretation of Nebuchadnezzar\\\'s dream is not considered part of the apocalyptic material presented in this book.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'FALSE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:20:04', '2017-01-19 20:20:04', 0, 0),
(401, 11, 'The Book of Daniel ends with a preview of eternity having the hope of the Resurrection.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:20:04', '2017-01-19 20:20:04', 0, 0),
(402, 11, 'The Books of Ezra and Nehemiah provide most of the information regarding the return of the Jews to their homeland.\r\n', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:25:04', '2017-01-19 20:25:04', 0, 0),
(403, 11, 'The return of the Jews occurred in two groups at two different times.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'FALSE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:25:04', '2017-01-19 20:25:04', 0, 0),
(404, 11, 'The Persian king Cyrus issued the decree for the return of the Jews to their homeland.\r\n', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:25:04', '2017-01-19 20:25:04', 0, 0),
(405, 11, 'The foundation of the new Temple was laid under the direction of Nehemiah.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'FALSE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:25:04', '2017-01-19 20:25:04', 0, 0),
(406, 11, 'Ezra led a group of exiles back to their homeland and also led the people in a revival.\r\n', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:25:04', '2017-01-19 20:25:04', 0, 0),
(407, 11, 'Nehemiah grew up in Persia and served as a cupbearer to Artaxerxes.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:25:04', '2017-01-19 20:25:04', 0, 0),
(408, 11, 'The walls of Jerusalem were rebuilt in only 42 days, thus fortifying the security of Jerusalem.\r\n', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'FALSE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:25:04', '2017-01-19 20:25:04', 0, 0),
(409, 11, 'Nehemiah led the people in a covenant renewal service.\r\n', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:25:04', '2017-01-19 20:25:04', 0, 0),
(410, 11, 'Nehemiah returned to Persia for a short time. When he returned to Jerusalem, he came back as the prime minister.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'FALSE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:25:04', '2017-01-19 20:25:04', 0, 0),
(411, 11, 'Upon Nehemiah\\\'s return to Jerusalem, he confronted three issues: tithing, honoring the Sabbath, and intermarriage.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:25:04', '2017-01-19 20:25:04', 0, 0),
(412, 11, 'The setting for the Book of Esther is the city of Susa, the capital of the Persian Empire.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:30:04', '2017-01-19 20:30:04', 0, 0),
(413, 11, 'Esther married the Persian monarch, Cyrus.\r\n', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'FALSE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:30:04', '2017-01-19 20:30:04', 0, 0),
(414, 11, 'Namaan plotted to destroy all the Jews in Persia.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'FALSE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:30:04', '2017-01-19 20:30:04', 0, 0),
(415, 11, 'Esther was placed on the throne by God in order to save her people, the Jews.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:30:04', '2017-01-19 20:30:04', 0, 0),
(416, 11, 'God?s name is not mentioned in the Book of Esther; however, this omission seems to serve as a reminder to the reader that God is still sovereign even when He seems to be silent.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:30:04', '2017-01-19 20:30:04', 0, 0),
(417, 11, 'Haggai?s younger contemporary was Zechariah.\r\n', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:30:04', '2017-01-19 20:30:04', 0, 0),
(418, 11, 'The two prophets, Haggai and Zechariah, challenged and motivated the people to resume the work of rebuilding the Temple.\r\n', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:30:04', '2017-01-19 20:30:04', 0, 0),
(419, 11, 'The new Temple built after the return of the Jews to Jerusalem, was bigger and more beautiful than Solomon?s Temple.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'FALSE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:30:04', '2017-01-19 20:30:04', 0, 0),
(420, 11, 'The new Temple was the one in which Christ ministered and proclaimed the kingdom of God.\r\n', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:30:04', '2017-01-19 20:30:04', 0, 0),
(421, 11, 'Zerubbabel was the last descendent of David to be appointed to rule over Israel.', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:30:04', '2017-01-19 20:30:04', 0, 0),
(422, 11, 'Unlike Jeremiah and Ezekiel, Zechariah was not a priest, he served only as a prophet.\r\n', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'FALSE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:35:03', '2017-01-19 20:35:03', 0, 0),
(423, 11, 'The name Zechariah means ?the Lord remembers.?', 'TRUE', 'FALSE', '', '', '', 'TRUE', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:35:03', '2017-01-19 20:35:03', 0, 0),
