(452, 12, '?A specific, crucial event or occurrence in one?s life? is the definition to______________.', 'Time', 'Season', 'Encounter', 'Interruption', '', 'Time', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:50:03', '2017-01-19 20:50:03', 0, 0),
