(464, 12, 'Spouses of the church planter can expect all the following, except . . .', 'More than likely the pastor?s wife will have to work.', 'Spouses will do substantial entertaining in the home.', 'Working outside the home and outside the ministry is extremely stressful.', 'Plenty of family time.', '', 'Plenty of family time.', 0.00, '2017-01-20 03:55:04', '2017-01-19 20:55:04', 0, 0),
