(570, 14, 'God is one person, but He exists and reveals Himself in three personalities?each one having a distinct purpose in the godhead.\r\n', 'True', 'False', '', '', '', 'True', 0.00, '2017-01-20 04:45:04', '2017-01-19 21:45:04', 0, 0),
