(50, 'Thomas', 'Sunny', 'Paul', 'meet.tsp@gmail.com', '00966535890397', '191', 'Gitto George Thampiu', 'Friend', '2007', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Good', 'Average', 'Highly Recommend', 'I met Gitto George Thampi in 2007 during my college days. He was my room mate in the hostel for some time too. He is a committed Christian  greatly involved in ministry. He plays keyboard and is active in church activities. During our stay in hostel, I had not seen him sleeping a single day without reading the Bible. He loves the word of God so much and shares it with others when he gets an opportunity. I had seen him reading the New testament in train journey even. Though he is currently working in the UAE,  his desire is to do full time ministry in future according to the will of God. May God fulfil his desire to learn more from the Bible and flourish in God\'s work in the years to come.', '2020-11-23 12:09:52', '2020-11-23 12:09:52', NULL),
