(65, 'George', NULL, 'Cherian', 'cheriangk@gmail.com', '(704)968-5119', '231', 'Deena Daniel', 'Pastor', '2020', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Poor', 'Highly Recommend', 'Sister Deena is an awesome individual, who has the capacity to lead and minister from the word of God.  In the time I have known her, she has proven to be a goal oriented person, who is willing to take charge in any circumstance.  She is a person of high integrity and moral standards.   She is a great team player, who is willing lend a hand to anyone who is in need.', '2022-02-17 14:56:36', '2022-02-17 14:56:36', NULL),
