(99, 'MyName', 'John', 'Alice', 'lxnpcbnf@do-not-respond.me', 'Hello', '--- Select Country ---', 'TestUser', '--- Select ---', 'MyName', '--- Select ---', '--- Select ---', '--- Select ---', '--- Select ---', '--- Select ---', '--- Select ---', '--- Select ---', '--- Select ---', '--- Select ---', 'erBRHHs PjRqxR JpNbv QujGe', '2025-03-20 21:23:40', '2025-03-20 21:23:40', NULL),
(100, 'Glen', 'Steve', 'Kinnard', 'stevekinnard@mac.com', '8455535111', '231', 'Steve Kinnard', 'Other', 'Over 10 ye', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', NULL, 'Highly Recommend', 'Julien is an excellent student and an excellent leader. If you accept him in your program, he will add to the quality of your program. I give him my highest recommendation. \r\nDr. G. Steve Kinnard', '2025-07-27 18:40:58', '2025-07-27 18:40:58', NULL),
(101, 'Glenn', NULL, 'Giles', 'ggiles@mtsem.org', '303-437-3807', '231', 'Kokouvi Julien Toyo', 'Other', 'September ', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Good', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Good', 'Highly Recommend', 'Kokouvi Julien Toyo is a staight A student and a graduate of our Rocky Mountain School of Ministry and Theology graduate school (now Mountain Theological Seminary) of which I am the President. Mr. Toyo is very bright, has a great gentle heart, and a desire to continue learning. He has high moral standards, has helped leading in our church in the Ivory Coast, has a wonderful family, and is fully committed to the Jesus\' church. I highly recommend Mr. Toyo into your programs at Trinity Theological Seminary. He will do very well!', '2025-07-27 18:58:59', '2025-07-27 18:58:59', NULL),
(102, 'William', NULL, 'Joseph', 'wjknight05@gmail.com', '770-871-0430', '231', 'Jaivi George', 'Friend', 'Give or ta', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Highly Recommend', 'I am honored to write this personal statement in support of my friend Jaivi as he applies for Bible school. I have known Jaivi for many years and during that time I have seen his faith, character, and love for God grow in steady and meaningful ways. He is someone who lives out his faith daily and I truly believe God has called him to prepare for ministry. Jaivi has a sincere heart for God that shows in the way he lives. His faith is not just something he talks about, but something he practices through his actions, choices, and relationships. He values prayer, seeks wisdom, and desires to follow God’s Word. Jaivi is humble, teachable, and always willing to learn, which are important qualities for someone pursuing ministry. One of the strongest examples of Jaivi’s calling is his role as a worship leader. He is musically talented, but his true strength is his heart for worship. When Jaivi leads, his focus is not on himself, but on pointing others to God. He leads with sincerity and respect for God’s presence, helping others connect with Him through worship. Many people are encouraged and blessed through his leadership. Jaivi also has a strong desire to serve beyond the worship team. At one point, Jaivi and I served together in a church council setting. During that time, I was able to see his leadership skills up close. He listened well, shared thoughtful ideas, and approached decisions with prayer and care for the church. That experience showed me that Jaivi is a natural leader who values unity and seeks what is best for others. Jaivi is deeply committed to his family and understands that ministry begins at home. As a husband and father, he leads with love, patience, and integrity. He is a strong role model for his children and sets a positive example of what it means to follow God. This same example carries over into the church, where he is a positive influence on youth and others around him. Beginning in 2026, Jaivi and his wife will step into a leadership role in the children’s church ministry. This role shows their shared heart for serving God together and for investing in the next generation. Jaivi understands how important it is to teach children about God in a clear, loving, and safe environment. He and his wife are committed to helping children grow in their faith and to supporting the volunteers who serve alongside them. Jaivi has shared with me his desire to pursue ministry more fully. I told him about TTS because I am currently a student on the same ministry pathway and have seen how valuable the training has been. This opportunity fits well with Jaivi’s calling and desire to grow in his knowledge of Scripture and leadership. Jaivi’s desire to attend Bible school comes from a place of obedience and preparation. He wants to be equipped to serve God and others well. I believe he would be a great addition to your school and would use what he learns to bless others. I highly recommend Jaivi for this program. I am confident God is guiding his steps, and I believe this is an important part of his journey. Jaivi has the character, heart, and calling to make a lasting impact for God’s Kingdom.', '2025-12-08 01:48:09', '2025-12-08 01:48:09', NULL);
