(10630, NULL, NULL, 'Laishram', 'Palendro', 'Meitei', 'palenxxx@gmail.com', NULL, 'Male', 101, 101, '7500328434', '1987-12-09', 'Married', 'Thoudam Sangeeta Devi', 0, 'Top khongnang Makhong', 'Imphal east', 'Manipur', 101, 'uploads/students/foto12jpg (1).jpg', '795005', 'Indian/Reunion', '12', 4, NULL, 2, 2025, 'Exhorter', 'I am a recent convert from Hinduism, and we do not yet have a fully established church for my community in our locality.', 'Yes', 'No', 'Unemployed', '25%', 'Here is a modified and enhanced version of your message, with improved clarity, tone, and flow:\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nGreetings in the name of our Lord Jesus Christ!\r\nI have a deep burden in my heart to serve the Lord through ministry. However, I currently have no financial or external support to pursue theological studies. I earnestly desire to study God’s Word in depth, as the Bible teaches that “it is not good to have zeal without knowledge” (Proverbs 19:2).\r\nAs a recent convert and born-again believer from the Meitei community, I am facing intense persecution—social isolation, mental harassment, emotional blackmail, and rejection from my own people. In the midst of these trials, my desire to grow in the knowledge of Scripture and be equipped for God’s work has only grown stronger.\r\nI humbly request your esteemed institute to kindly consider granting me an opportunity to study God\'s Word through your program. I believe this will be a crucial step in fulfilling God’s calling upon my life.\r\n\r\nThank you for your kind consideration.', 'palenxxx@gmail.com', 'NA', 'palenxxx@gmail.com', 'Na', 'Na', 'Na', 'Na', 'palenxxx@gmail.com', 'Na', 'uploads/certificates/1/MSW certificate-compressed.pdf', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-02 04:06:09', '2025-08-02 04:06:09', 1, 1),
