(891, 1, '2014-07-16 04:09:24', '2014-07-16 04:09:24', '[vc_row u_row_style=\"1\" u_row_paralax=\"0\" u_row_scheme=\"0\" css=\".vc_custom_1504686660644{margin-bottom: 0px !important;padding-top: 60px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;background-color: #ffffff !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][textbox icon=\"fa-graduation-cap\" link=\"about-us/\" heading=\"ABOUT TRINITY \" schema=\"light\" icon_background_color=\"#179bd7\" icon_background_hover=\"#222222\" heading_color=\"#222222\" content_color=\"#444444\" css_animation=\"left-to-right\" animation_delay=\"0.25\"]Trinity Theological Seminary online seminary is run by Saviour Foundation Inc. Registerd under the law of USA. Programs offer both Undergraduate and Graduate studies in a number of Christian majors.[/textbox][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][textbox icon=\"fa-paper-plane\" link=\"accreditation/\" heading=\"ACCREDITATION\" schema=\"light\" icon_background_color=\"#179bd7\" icon_background_hover=\"#222222\" heading_color=\"#222222\" content_color=\"#444444\" css_animation=\"top-to-bottom\" animation_delay=\"0.3\"]Concerning seminary accreditation; the value of any accredited university, accredited bible college or accredited online seminary degree is subjective, depending on the amount of work that went into earning it, the student\'s attitude and aptitude, and external circumstances related to the school itself or to the graduate\'s working world.[/textbox][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][textbox icon=\"fa-ticket\" link=\"admission-process/\" heading=\"ADMISSIONS\" schema=\"light\" icon_background_color=\"#179bd7\" icon_background_hover=\"#222222\" heading_color=\"#222222\" content_color=\"#444444\" css_animation=\"bottom-to-top\" animation_delay=\"0.45\"]Admissions at TTS are open for all eligible applicants without discrimination based on caste, creed, language, color, nationalities or political boundaries.[/textbox][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row u_row_style=\"1\" u_row_paralax=\"0\" u_row_scheme=\"0\" css=\".vc_custom_1504686719142{padding-top: 30px !important;padding-bottom: 50px !important;background-color: #ffffff !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][textbox icon=\" fa-star\" link=\"doctoral-program/\" heading=\"ACADEMIC PROGRAMS\" schema=\"light\" icon_background_color=\"#179bd7\" icon_background_hover=\"#222222\" heading_color=\"#222222\" content_color=\"#444444\" css_animation=\"right-to-left\" animation_delay=\"0.6\"]The Doctor of Ministry (D.Min) is the highest professional degree for those in parish or related ministries. It is designed for educated, experienced practitioners of Christian faith, who desire to stimulate renewal in themselves, and in their ministries through advanced training, research and reflection. [/textbox][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][textbox icon=\"fa-cubes\" link=\"make-payment/\" heading=\"PAYMENT OPTIONS\" schema=\"light\" icon_background_color=\"#179bd7\" icon_background_hover=\"#222222\" heading_color=\"#222222\" content_color=\"#444444\" css_animation=\"top-to-bottom\" animation_delay=\"0.75\"]Trinity Theological Seminary online seminary programs offer both Undergraduate and Graduate studies in a number of Christian majors.[/textbox][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row u_row_style=\"1\" u_row_paralax=\"1\" u_row_scheme=\"1\" css=\".vc_custom_1504686734562{padding-top: 100px !important;padding-bottom: 100px !important;background-image: url(http://university.cactusthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/section-background.jpg?id=985) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_column_text css_animation=\"bottom-to-top\"]\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Contact Soon For Your Enrollment!</h1>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><strong>Our goal and vision is to provide quality, accredited theological education to anyone in the world who has access to the Internet. </strong></em></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><strong>We invite you to browse our undergraduate and graduate degree programs.</strong></em></p>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row u_row_style=\"1\" u_row_paralax=\"0\" u_row_scheme=\"0\" css=\".vc_custom_1504686747832{padding-top: 60px !important;padding-bottom: 60px !important;}\"][vc_column][u_post_grid title=\"Our Courses\" description=\"Trinity Theological Seminary online seminary programs offer both Undergraduate and Graduate studies in a number of Christian majors.\" link_text=\"VIEW COURSE\" column=\"4\" post_type=\"u_course\" show_date=\"1\" show_price=\"1\" show_venue=\"1\" show_cat_name=\"0\" show_time=\"1\" gallery=\"0\" css_animation=\"bottom-to-top\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row u_row_style=\"1\" u_row_paralax=\"1\" u_row_scheme=\"1\" css=\".vc_custom_1504686765596{margin-bottom: 0px !important;padding-top: 160px !important;padding-bottom: 160px !important;background-image: url(http://university.cactusthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/university-background-03.jpg?id=2624) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_row_inner css=\".vc_custom_1406950310766{padding-top: 50px !important;padding-bottom: 40px !important;}\"][vc_column_inner][vc_column_text css_animation=\"left-to-right\"]\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: right;\">Create an account for personalized experience.</h1>\r\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css_animation=\"bottom-to-top\"]\r\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">[ct_button id=\"button_19\" size=\"big\" solid=\"0\" link=\"new-admission-form/\" icon=\"fa-leaf\" arrow=\"0\" color=\"#\"]NEW ADMISSION FORM[/ct_button]</p>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][vc_column_text css_animation=\"top-to-bottom\"]\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Financial Scholarships are available to reduce the tuition for your degree .</h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Your Life Learning experiences and previous education are used to reduce the degree requirements...</h1>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Front Page', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'university-revolution-slider', '', '', '2017-09-06 04:33:45', '2017-09-06 08:33:45', '', 0, 'http://university.cactusthemes.com/?page_id=891', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(3466, 1, '2017-05-16 02:53:25', '2017-05-16 06:53:25', '[vc_row u_row_style=\"0\" u_row_paralax=\"0\" u_row_scheme=\"0\" css=\".vc_custom_1406014454624{margin-bottom: 0px !important;padding-top: 60px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;background-color: #ffffff !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][textbox icon=\"fa-graduation-cap\" link=\"about-us/\" heading=\"ABOUT TRINITY \" schema=\"light\" icon_background_color=\"#179bd7\" icon_background_hover=\"#222222\" heading_color=\"#222222\" content_color=\"#444444\" css_animation=\"left-to-right\" animation_delay=\"0.25\"]Trinity Theological Seminary online seminary is run by Saviour Foundation Inc. Registerd under the law of USA. Programs offer both Undergraduate and Graduate studies in a number of Christian majors.[/textbox][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][textbox icon=\"fa-paper-plane\" link=\"accreditation/\" heading=\"ACCREDITATION\" schema=\"light\" icon_background_color=\"#179bd7\" icon_background_hover=\"#222222\" heading_color=\"#222222\" content_color=\"#444444\" css_animation=\"top-to-bottom\" animation_delay=\"0.3\"]Concerning seminary accreditation; the value of any accredited university, accredited bible college or accredited online seminary degree is subjective, depending on the amount of work that went into earning it, the student\'s attitude and aptitude, and external circumstances related to the school itself or to the graduate\'s working world.[/textbox][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][textbox icon=\"fa-ticket\" link=\"admission-process/\" heading=\"ADMISSIONS\" schema=\"light\" icon_background_color=\"#179bd7\" icon_background_hover=\"#222222\" heading_color=\"#222222\" content_color=\"#444444\" css_animation=\"bottom-to-top\" animation_delay=\"0.45\"]Admissions at TTS are open for all eligible applicants without discrimination based on caste, creed, language, color, nationalities or political boundaries.[/textbox][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row u_row_style=\"0\" u_row_paralax=\"0\" u_row_scheme=\"0\" css=\".vc_custom_1406014237051{padding-top: 30px !important;padding-bottom: 50px !important;background-color: #ffffff !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][textbox icon=\" fa-star\" link=\"doctoral-program/\" heading=\"ACADEMIC PROGRAMS\" schema=\"light\" icon_background_color=\"#179bd7\" icon_background_hover=\"#222222\" heading_color=\"#222222\" content_color=\"#444444\" css_animation=\"right-to-left\" animation_delay=\"0.6\"]The Doctor of Ministry (D.Min) is the highest professional degree for those in parish or related ministries. It is designed for educated, experienced practitioners of Christian faith, who desire to stimulate renewal in themselves, and in their ministries through advanced training, research and reflection. [/textbox][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][textbox icon=\"fa-cubes\" link=\"make-payment/\" heading=\"PAYMENT OPTIONS\" schema=\"light\" icon_background_color=\"#179bd7\" icon_background_hover=\"#222222\" heading_color=\"#222222\" content_color=\"#444444\" css_animation=\"top-to-bottom\" animation_delay=\"0.75\"]Trinity Theological Seminary online seminary programs offer both Undergraduate and Graduate studies in a number of Christian majors.[/textbox][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row u_row_style=\"0\" u_row_paralax=\"1\" u_row_scheme=\"1\" css=\".vc_custom_1405655980092{padding-top: 100px !important;padding-bottom: 100px !important;background-image: url(http://university.cactusthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/section-background.jpg?id=985) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_column_text css_animation=\"bottom-to-top\"]\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Contact Soon For Your Enrollment!</h1>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><strong>Our goal and vision is to provide quality, accredited theological education to anyone in the world who has access to the Internet. </strong></em></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-a