(3297, 1, '2017-02-19 06:22:32', '2017-02-19 06:22:32', '[vc_row u_row_style=\"0\" u_row_paralax=\"0\" u_row_scheme=\"0\" css=\".vc_custom_1406014454624{margin-bottom: 0px !important;padding-top: 60px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;background-color: #ffffff !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][textbox icon=\"fa-graduation-cap\" heading=\"ABOUT TRINITY \" schema=\"light\" icon_background_color=\"#179bd7\" icon_background_hover=\"#222222\" heading_color=\"#222222\" content_color=\"#444444\" css_animation=\"left-to-right\" animation_delay=\"0.25\"]Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt lorem ipsum[/textbox][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][textbox icon=\"fa-paper-plane\" heading=\"WE BELIEVE\" schema=\"light\" icon_background_color=\"#179bd7\" icon_background_hover=\"#222222\" heading_color=\"#222222\" content_color=\"#444444\" css_animation=\"top-to-bottom\" animation_delay=\"0.3\"]ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi[/textbox][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][textbox icon=\"fa-ticket\" heading=\"ACCREDITATION\" schema=\"light\" icon_background_color=\"#179bd7\" icon_background_hover=\"#222222\" heading_color=\"#222222\" content_color=\"#444444\" css_animation=\"bottom-to-top\" animation_delay=\"0.45\"]You can use this theme for university, training center, non-profit organization. There is no limits to University.[/textbox][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row u_row_style=\"0\" u_row_paralax=\"0\" u_row_scheme=\"0\" css=\".vc_custom_1406014237051{padding-top: 30px !important;padding-bottom: 50px !important;background-color: #ffffff !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][textbox icon=\"fa-shopping-cart\" heading=\"ADMISSIONS\" schema=\"light\" icon_background_color=\"#179bd7\" icon_background_hover=\"#222222\" heading_color=\"#222222\" content_color=\"#444444\" css_animation=\"right-to-left\" animation_delay=\"0.6\"]At vero eos et accusamus et iusto odio dignissimos ducimus qui blanditiis praesentium voluptatum[/textbox][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][textbox icon=\"fa-cubes\" heading=\"ACADEMIC PROGRAMS\" schema=\"light\" icon_background_color=\"#179bd7\" icon_background_hover=\"#222222\" heading_color=\"#222222\" content_color=\"#444444\" css_animation=\"top-to-bottom\" animation_delay=\"0.75\"]Quis autem vel eum iure reprehenderit qui in ea voluptate velit esse quam nihil molestiae consequatur dignissimos[/textbox][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][textbox icon=\"fa-star\" heading=\"PAYMENT OPTIONS\" schema=\"light\" icon_background_color=\"#179bd7\" icon_background_hover=\"#222222\" heading_color=\"#222222\" content_color=\"#444444\" css_animation=\"right-to-left\" animation_delay=\"0.9\"]We provide free support for customers from Monday to Friday. Contact us for any issues you have[/textbox][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row u_row_style=\"0\" u_row_paralax=\"1\" u_row_scheme=\"1\" css=\".vc_custom_1405655980092{padding-top: 100px !important;padding-bottom: 100px !important;background-image: url(http://university.cactusthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/section-background.jpg?id=985) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_column_text css_animation=\"bottom-to-top\"]\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Contact Soon For Your Enrollment!</h1>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><strong>Our goal and vision is to provide quality, accredited theological education to anyone in the world who has access to the Internet. </strong></em></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><strong>We invite you to browse our undergraduate and graduate degree programs.</strong></em></p>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row u_row_style=\"0\" u_row_paralax=\"0\" u_row_scheme=\"0\" css=\".vc_custom_1405655183720{padding-top: 60px !important;padding-bottom: 60px !important;}\"][vc_column][u_p