(3322, 1, '2018-10-01 00:54:00', '2018-10-01 04:54:00', '[vc_row parallax=\"content-moving\" parallax_image=\"3320\" u_row_style=\"1\" u_row_paralax=\"0\" u_row_scheme=\"1\" el_class=\"about_left\"][vc_column][u_heading]Admissions at TTS are open for all eligible applicants without discrimination based on caste, creed, language, color, nationalities or political boundaries.[/u_heading][vc_column_text]<strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">APPLICATION PROCEDURE</span></strong>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">To apply for admission in English or Hindi complete the following formalities</span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Complete the online application form given in www.mytts.org\r\n</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Upload the supporting documents.</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Pay the Enrollment fee + Course fees online for all courses.</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">On successful completion of your application, TTS will Email you the student registration number, login user name and password to access your course details, materials, assignments, book review details etc.</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The minimum duration is stipulated in the prospectus and if a student fails to complete the course within the allowed extended duration, he/she is expected to re-register and start the entire process as a new student.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\">GRADING SYSTEM FOR ALL COURSES</span></h3>\r\n<table class=\"admission\" border=\"0\" width=\"930\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#999999\">\r\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">GRADING SYSTEM</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">FIRST CLASS</span></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">SECOND CLASS</span></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">THIRD CLASS</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><label>A+ 80% &amp; above </label></span></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><label>B+ 65% </label></span></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><label>C+ 50%</label></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><label>A 75% </label></span></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><label>B 60%</label></span></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><label>C 45%</label></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><label>A- 70%</label></span></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><label>B- 55%</label></span></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><label>C- 40%</label></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">*Below 40% is considered as failed.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Admission Process', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2912-autosave-v1', '', '', '2018-10-01 00:54:00', '2018-10-01 04:54:00', '', 2912, 'http://elittee.com/trinity/2912-autosave-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(3323, 1, '2017-03-24 04:58:26', '2017-03-24 04:58:26', 'Admissions at TTS are open for all eligible applicants without discrimination based on caste, creed, language, color, nationalities or political boundaries.\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">APPLICATION PROCEDURE</span></h3>\r\nTo apply for admission complete the following formalities\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #33cccc;\">Complete the on-line application form given in <a href=\"http://www.mytrinityworld.com\">www.mytrinityworld.com</a>\r\n</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #33cccc;\">Upload the supporting documents.</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #33cccc;\">Pay the Enrollment fee + Course fees online for all courses.</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #33cccc;\">On successful completion of your application, TTS will Email you the student registration number, login user name and password to access your course details, materials, assignments, book review details etc.</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #33cccc;\">The minimum duration is stipulated in the prospectus and if a student fails to complete the course within the allowed extended duration, he/she is expected to re-register and start the entire process as a new student.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: #0000cc;\">GRADING SYSTEM FOR ALL COURSES</span></h3>\r\n<table class=\"admission\" border=\"0\" width=\"930\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#999999\">\r\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\">GRADING SYSTEM</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><label>FIRST CLASS</label></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><label>SECOND CLASS</label></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\">&nbsp;\r\n\r\nTHIRD CLASS</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><label>A+ 80% &amp; above </label></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><label>B+ 65% </label></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><label>C+ 50%</label></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><label>A 75% </label></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><label>B 60%</label></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><label>C 45%</label></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><label>A- 70%</label></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><label>B- 55%</label></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><label>C- 40%</label></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\">*Below 40% is considered as failed.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Admission Process', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2912-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-03-24 04:58:26', '2017-03-24 04:58:26', '', 2912, 'http://elittee.com/trinity/2912-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(3324, 1, '2017-09-06 02:03:28', '2017-09-06 06:03:28', '[vc_row full_height=\"yes\" columns_placement=\"top\" content_placement=\"top\" parallax=\"content-moving\" parallax_image=\"3418\" u_row_style=\"1\" u_row_paralax=\"0\" u_row_scheme=\"1\"][vc_column el_class=\"about_left\"][contact-form-7 id=\"254\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][contact-form-7 id=\"254\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Contact Us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '252-autosave-v1', '', '', '2017-09-06 02:03:28', '2017-09-06 06:03:28', '', 252, 'http://elittee.com/trinity/252-autosave-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(3325, 1, '2017-03-24 05:26:14', '2017-03-24 05:26:14', '', 'contact', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'contact', '', '', '2017-03-24 05:26:14', '2017-03-24 05:26:14', '', 252, 'http://elittee.com/trinity/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/contact.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(3329, 1, '2017-03-24 05:39:31', '2017-03-24 05:39:31', '[vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]<strong>A Complete online Theological Educational Institution Accreditated by International Association for Theological Accreditation</strong>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"2/3\"][vc_column_text]\r\n<h2></h2>\r\n<div class=\"about_left\">\r\n\r\nTrinity Theological Seminary online seminary is run by Saviour Foundation Inc. Registerd under the law of USA. Programs offer both Undergraduate and Graduate studies in a number of Christian majors. Bachelor Degree, Master Degree, and Doctorate Degree Programs are offered with courses that build foundational blocks to allow students to easily move not only from one course to another, but also provide the incentive to move on towards the next level of degree studies with accomplished core courses.\r\n\r\nThe courses are structured in a simple format to provide students basic understanding of the main principles allowing the students to move through their degree courses, and in turn their programs at a faster pace. Since online students study independently at their own pace., TTS Model allows those that are motivated to complete their studies much sooner than in traditionally controlled programs.\r\n\r\nAlthough you study at your own pace, their is always access to a personal academic advisor that will assist you when needed.\r\n\r\nStudents will work from the TTS Model. Course instructions, textbooks, and required assignments are provided for each course in the TTS Model. Students even upload their completed assignments directly to the TTS Model making it a secure way to submit course work. No need to postal mail your completed work, simply upload to the TTS Model system.\r\n\r\nStructure within the Graduate Studies in the Accelerated Academic Degree Programs (AADP). This program allows students that have completed previous studies in compatible courses to complete their program in as little as 12 weeks to 1 year.\r\n\r\nWith the online program structure and format, self-paced courses, and the support systems in place for completing the degree programs in the least amount of time possible, TTS has become a leading online seminary.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][vc_column_text]sadsadasdasas[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'About US', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2855-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-03-24 05:39:31', '2017-03-24 05:39:31', '', 2855, 'http://elittee.com/trinity/2855-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
