s to 1 year.\r\n\r\nWith the online program structure and format, self-paced courses, and the support systems in place for completing the degree programs in the least amount of time possible, TTS has become a leading online seminary.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][vc_column_text][staff-list][/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'About US', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2855-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-03-24 06:11:51', '2017-03-24 06:11:51', '', 2855, 'http://elittee.com/trinity/2855-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
