\n\r\nWith the online program structure and format, self-paced courses, and the support systems in place for completing the degree programs in the least amount of time possible, TTS has become a leading online seminary.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]\r\n\r\n[staff-list]\r\n\r\n[/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'About US', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2855-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-04-24 17:12:08', '2017-04-24 17:12:08', '', 2855, 'http://www.mytrinityworld.com/2855-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
