d previous studies in compatible courses to complete their program in as little as 12 weeks to 1 year.\r\n\r\nWith the online program structure and format, self-paced courses, and the support systems in place for completing the degree programs in the least amount of time possible, TTS has become a leading online seminary.</div>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_separator][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n\r\n[staff-list]\r\n\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'About US', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2855-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-05-04 07:35:18', '2017-05-04 07:35:18', '', 2855, 'http://www.mytrinityworld.com/2855-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
