(3399, 1, '2017-05-05 06:13:13', '2017-05-05 06:13:13', '[vc_row full_height=\"yes\" content_placement=\"middle\" parallax=\"content-moving\" parallax_image=\"3325\" u_row_style=\"0\" u_row_paralax=\"0\" u_row_scheme=\"0\"][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][contact-form-7 id=\"254\" title=\"Contact form 1\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\" css=\".vc_custom_1494009319457{background-image: url(http://www.mytrinityworld.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/contact.jpg?id=3325) !important;}\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Contact Us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '252-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-05-05 06:13:13', '2017-05-05 06:13:13', '', 252, 'http://www.mytrinityworld.com/252-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(3404, 1, '2017-05-05 06:33:14', '2017-05-05 06:33:14', '[vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]The ultimate aim and vision to start Trinity Theological Seminary is to train the leaders equipping them in His Word to be effective Ministers of Gospel. Our desire is “TTS will provide the best biblical education at the most affordable price.” This is a nonprofit organization which offers significantly lower tuition than most traditional universities and for-profit schools with similar programming. We work with all of our students as close as we can to meet their particular budget.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n<table style=\"height: 90px;\" width=\"528\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Undergraduate Level Tuition</td>\r\n<td>$100.00/semester credit hour</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Master’s Level Tuition</td>\r\n<td>$150.00/semester credit hour</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Doctoral Level Tuition</td>\r\n<td>$200.00/semester credit hour</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]Keep in mind that these tuition costs are prior to factoring in any grants, discounts or tuition assistance. With available grants, the payment for most students taking 4-5 courses per enrollment period is between $100 and $150.00 a month depending upon degree level. To keep costs low, Trinity offers its own financing for students through deferred payments on the remaining balance of their tuition and fees not paid at the time of enrollment.\r\n\r\nPlease call and speak with an Enrollment Advisor with any questions.\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Fees Structure', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3344-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-05-05 06:33:14', '2017-05-05 06:33:14', '', 3344, 'http://www.mytrinityworld.com/3344-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(3403, 1, '2017-05-05 06:31:24', '2017-05-05 06:31:24', '[vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]The ultimate aim and vision to start Trinity Theological Seminary is to train the leaders equipping them in His Word to be effective Ministers of Gospel. Our desire is “TTS will provide the best biblical education at the most affordable price.” This is a nonprofit organization which offers significantly lower tuition than most traditional universities and for-profit schools with similar programming. We work with all of our students as close as we can to meet their particular budget.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n<table style=\"height: 90px;\" width=\"528\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Undergraduate Level Tuition</td>\r\n<td>$100.00/semester credit hour</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Master’s Level Tuition</td>\r\n<td>$150.00/semester credit hour</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Doctoral Level Tuition</td>\r\n<td>$200.00/semester credit hour</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]Keep in mind that these tuition costs are prior to factoring in any grants, discounts or tuition assistance. With available grants, the payment for most students taking 4-5 courses per enrollment period is between $100 and $150.00 a month depending upon degree level. To keep costs low, Trinity offers its own financing for students through deferred payments on the remaining balance of their tuition and fees not paid at the time of enrollment.\r\n\r\nPlease call and speak with an Enrollment Advisor with any questions.\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Fees Structure', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3344-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-05-05 06:31:24', '2017-05-05 06:31:24', '', 3344, 'http://www.mytrinityworld.com/3344-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(3402, 1, '2017-05-05 06:27:06', '2017-05-05 06:27:06', '[vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]The ultimate aim and vision to start Trinity Theological Seminary is to train the leaders equipping them in His Word to be effective Ministers of Gospel. Our desire is “TTS will provide the best biblical education at the most affordable price.” This is a nonprofit organization which offers significantly lower tuition than most traditional universities and for-profit schools with similar programming. We work with all of our students as close as we can to meet their particular budget.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][price price=\"100.00/semester credit hour\" price_text=\"Undergraduate Level Tuition\"][vc_column_text]\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Undergraduate Level Tuition</td>\r\n<td>$100.00/semester credit hour</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Master’s Level Tuition</td>\r\n<td>$150.00/semester credit hour</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Doctoral Level Tuition</td>\r\n<td>$200.00/semester credit hour</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]Keep in mind that these tuition costs are prior to factoring in any grants, discounts or tuition assistance. With available grants, the payment for most students taking 4-5 courses per enrollment period is between $100 and $150.00 a month depending upon degree level. To keep costs low, Trinity offers its own financing for students through deferred payments on the remaining balance of their tuition and fees not paid at the time of enrollment.\r\n\r\nPlease call and speak with an Enrollment Advisor with any questions.\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Fees Structure', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3344-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-05-05 06:27:06', '2017-05-05 06:27:06', '', 3344, 'http://www.mytrinityworld.com/3344-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(3406, 1, '2017-05-05 06:47:40', '2017-05-05 06:47:40', '', 'UniversityStudents', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'universitystudents', '', '', '2017-05-05 06:47:40', '2017-05-05 06:47:40', '', 2855, 'http://www.mytrinityworld.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/UniversityStudents.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(3407, 1, '2017-05-05 06:50:10', '2017-05-05 06:50:10', '[vc_row full_height=\"yes\" columns_placement=\"top\" content_placement=\"top\" parallax=\"content-moving-fade\" parallax_image=\"3406\" u_row_style=\"1\" u_row_paralax=\"0\" u_row_scheme=\"1\"][vc_column][u_heading]A complete online Theological Educational Institution Accredited by International Association for Theological Accreditation[/u_heading][vc_column_text]\r\n<div class=\"about_left\">\r\n\r\nTrinity Theological Seminary online seminary is run by Saviour Foundation Inc. Registerd under the law of USA. Programs offer both Undergraduate and Graduate studies in a number of Christian majors. Bachelor Degree, Master Degree, and Doctorate Degree Programs are offered with courses that build foundational blocks to allow students to easily move not only from one course to another, but also provide the incentive to move on towards the next level of degree studies with accomplished core courses.\r\n\r\nThe courses are structured in a simple format to provide students basic understanding of the main principles allowing the students to move through their degree courses, and in turn their programs at a faster pace. Since online students study independently at their own pace., TTS Model allows those that are motivated to complete their studies much sooner than in traditionally controlled programs.\r\n\r\nAlthough you study at your own pace, their is always access to a personal academic advisor that will assist you when needed.\r\n\r\nStudents will work from the TTS Model. Course instructions, textbooks, and required assignments are provided for each course in the TTS Model. Students even upload their completed assignments directly to the TTS Model making it a secure way to submit course work. No need to postal mail your completed work, simply upload to the TTS Model system.\r\n\r\nStructure within the Graduate Studies in the Accelerated Academic Degree Programs (AADP). This program allows students that have completed previous studies in compatible courses to complete their program in as little as 12 weeks to 1 year.\r\n\r\nWith the online program structure and format, self-paced courses, and the support systems in place for completing the degree programs in the least amount of time possible, TTS has become a leading online seminary.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_separator][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n\r\n[staff-list]\r\n\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'About US', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2855-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-05-05 06:50:10', '2017-05-05 06:50:10', '', 2855, 'http://www.mytrinityworld.com/2855-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
