(3456, 1, '2017-05-11 07:28:20', '2017-05-11 07:28:20', '[vc_row parallax=\"content-moving\" parallax_image=\"3294\" u_row_style=\"1\" u_row_paralax=\"0\" u_row_scheme=\"1\"][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Scholarships are available for eligible students for all courses. You can Email us to our email ID <em><strong>trinitytheologicalseminary@gmail.com</strong></em> with your full bio-data explaining why full or partial scholarships should be made available for you. Do remember to attach all the necessary documents along with the mail, in order for our management to verify. Applying alone does not guarantee any scholarship, as all scholarships are fully based on management discretion, which may not give any reasons whatsoever for its decisions.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Generally, TTS Scholarships are available for the following category of students, who are economically backward having good academic grades in the qualifying exams:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Clergy (Priests &amp; Pastors) - without any discrimination to denominations or sects.</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Children or any direct dependents of the clergy.</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Bible school graduates.</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Final year graduate students.</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Mature Applicants.</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">House wives.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Note: The entire above category should provide a strong letter of recommendation from the head of the local church, supported by proofs of the claims. All submitted applications will be thoroughly scrutinized by the TTS Management and is subject to exposure to other individuals as well.</span></p>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Scholarship', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2978-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-05-11 07:28:20', '2017-05-11 07:28:20', '', 2978, 'http://www.mytrinityworld.com/2978-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(3458, 1, '2017-05-11 07:44:49', '2017-05-11 07:44:49', '[vc_row][vc_column][u_heading]Admissions at TTS are open for all eligible applicants without discrimination based on caste, creed, language, color, nationalities or political boundaries.[/u_heading][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row parallax=\"content-moving\" parallax_image=\"3320\" u_row_style=\"1\" u_row_paralax=\"0\" u_row_scheme=\"1\"][vc_column][vc_column_text]<strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">APPLICATION PROCEDURE</span></strong>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">To apply for admission complete the following formalities</span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Complete the on-line application form given in <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"http://www.mytrinityworld.com\">www.mytrinityworld.com</a>\r\n</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Upload the supporting documents.</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Pay the Enrollment fee + Course fees online for all courses.</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">On successful completion of your application, TTS will Email you the student registration number, login user name and password to access your course details, materials, assignments, book review details etc.</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The minimum duration is stipulated in the prospectus and if a student fails to complete the course within the allowed extended duration, he/she is expected to re-register and start the entire process as a new student.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\">GRADING SYSTEM FOR ALL COURSES</span></h3>\r\n<table class=\"admission\" border=\"0\" width=\"930\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#999999\">\r\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">GRADING SYSTEM</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">FIRST CLASS</span></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">SECOND CLASS</span></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">THIRD CLASS</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><label>A+ 80% &amp; above </label></span></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><label>B+ 65% </label></span></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><label>C+ 50%</label></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><label>A 75% </label></span></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><label>B 60%</label></span></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><label>C 45%</label></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><label>A- 70%</label></span></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><label>B- 55%</label></span></td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><label>C- 40%</label></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">*Below 40% is considered as failed.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Admission Process', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2912-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-05-11 07:44:49', '2017-05-11 07:44:49', '', 2912, 'http://www.